## Database

Migrations live in `alembic/` and run against a sync driver, even where the app
uses an async engine.

```sh
just migrate                  # apply everything pending
just revision "add users"     # autogenerate from the models
just downgrade                # roll back one
```

`just revision` inspects the live database to diff it against the models, so it
fails unless the database is reachable{% if container %} — `docker compose up -d postgres` first{% endif %}. Without one, write the
migration by hand or use `alembic revision` with no `--autogenerate`.
